      "@type": "dcat:Dataset",
      "title": "IDEA Section 618 Data Products: Static Tables- Part C",
      "description": "#IDEA Section 618 Data Products: Static Tables\n##Part C Child Count and Settings\n1. [Number of infants and toddlers ages birth through 2 and 3 and older, and percentage of population, receiving early intervention services under IDEA, Part C, by age and state.][Static-C-Count-1]\n2. [Number and percent of infants and toddlers receiving early intervention services under IDEA, Part C, by age group, gender and state.][Static-C-Count-2]\n3. [Number of at-risk infants and toddlers ages birth through 2 receiving early intervention services under IDEA, Part C, by age and state.][Static-C-Count-3]\n4. [Number and percent of infants and toddlers receiving early intervention services under IDEA, Part C, by age and state.][Static-C-Count-4]\n5. [Number and percent of infants and toddlers receiving early intervention services under IDEA, Part C, by age and state and race/ethnicity.][Static-C-Count-5]\n6. [Number and percent of at-risk infants and toddlers birth through 2 receiving early intervention services under IDEA, Part C, by race/ethnicity and state.][Static-C-Count-6]\n7. [Number of infants and toddlers birth through 2 served under IDEA, Part C, by early intervention setting and state.][Static-C-Count-7]\n8. [Number and percent of infants and toddlers ages birth through 2 served under IDEA, Part C, by early intervention setting and state and race/ethnicity.][Static-C-Count-8]\n9. [Number of and percent infants and toddlers ages three and older served under IDEA, Part C, by early intervention setting and state and race/ethnicity.][Static-C-Count-9]\n10. [Cumulative count of infants and toddlers birth through age 2 receiving early intervention services under IDEA, Part C, by gender and state][Static-C-Count-10]\n11. [Cumulative count of infants and toddlers birth through age 2 receiving early intervention services under IDEA, Part C, by race/ethnicity and state][Static-C-Count-11]\n\n##Part C Dispute Resolution\n1. [Number and percent of written, signed complaints through dispute resolution procedures for infants and toddlers ages birth through 2 years, served under IDEA, Part C, by case status and state.][Static-C-Dispute-1]\n2. [Number and percent of mediations held through dispute resolution procedures for infants and toddlers ages birth through 2 years, served under IDEA, Part C, by case status and state.][Static-C-Dispute-2]\n3. [Number and percent of hearings (fully adjudicated) through dispute resolution procedures for infants and toddlers ages birth through 2 years, served under IDEA, Part C, by case status and state.][Static-C-Dispute-3]\n\n##Part C Exiting\n1. [Number of infants and toddlers ages birth through 2 served under IDEA, Part C, who exited Part C programs, by exit reason and state.][Static-C-Exiting-1]\n2. [Number of infants and toddlers through age 2 with disabilities served under IDEA, Part C, who exited Part C, by exit reason and state by race/ethnicity.][Static-C-Exiting-2]\n3. [Number and percent of male/female infants and toddlers ages birth through 2 with disabilities served under IDEA, Part C, who exited Part C, by exit reason and state.][Static-C-Exiting-3]\n\n[Static-C-Count-1]: idea-section-618-data-products-static-tables-part-c-child-count-and-settings-table-1\n[Static-C-Count-2]: idea-section-618-data-products-static-tables-part-c-child-count-and-settings-table-2\n[Static-C-Count-3]: idea-section-618-data-products-static-tables-part-c-child-count-and-settings-table-3\n[Static-C-Count-4]: idea-section-618-data-products-static-tables-part-c-child-count-and-settings-table-4\n[Static-C-Count-5]: idea-section-618-data-products-static-tables-part-c-child-count-and-settings-table-5\n[Static-C-Count-6]: idea-section-618-data-products-static-tables-part-c-child-count-and-settings-table-6\n[Static-C-Count-7]: idea-section-618-data-products-static-tables-part-c-child-count-and-settings-table-7\n[Static-C-Count-8]: idea-section-618-data-products-static-tables-part-c-child-count-and-settings